---
import Feather from '../assets/feather.png';
---

<section class="quill-section">
    <div class="backdrop">
        <img src={Feather.src} alt="Feather Icon" class="feather-top" />
    </div>
  <div class="quill-text">
    <h1>Helping people see clearly, equipping them well, and stewarding ideas through complex systems.</h1>
  </div>  
  <div class="quill">
    
    <p>Below are examples of how this work takes shape—through web applications and tools
  designed to bring clarity, support thoughtful leadership, and steward ideas within complex systems.
</p>
</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.quill-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 2rem 3rem;
  font-family: var(--font-main);
  color:antiquewhite;
  line-height: 1.75; 
}

.feather-top {
  width: 10rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  margin-top: 1rem; /* new */
  opacity: 0.9;
}

.backdrop{
  background-color: var(--pale-linen);
  padding: 0.75rem;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* optional soft shadow */
  margin-left: 2rem;
}

.quill-text {
  margin-left: 4rem;         /* ⬅️ Pull it left */
  margin-right: 6vw;         /* ✅ Keeps that nice right margin */
  max-width: 60rem;          /* ⬅️ Make it wider */
  font-size: var(--font-body, 1.5rem);
  color: antiquewhite;           
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.quill {
  color: antiquewhite;
  margin-left: 4rem;         /* ⬅️ Pull it left */
  margin-right: 6vw;         /* ✅ Keeps that nice right margin */
  max-width: 60rem;          /* ⬅️ Make it wider */
  font-size: var(--font-body, 1.5rem);
             
  line-height: 1.8;
}

</style>
